WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:02.630
- Hmm, that's a good call.

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:04.130
- Yeah, I know.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.480
- Thank you, he-hey.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.190
(hands slap)

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:09.180
- Uh, what about the rest of us?

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:10.640
- Sorry dude, it's a two-for-one.

00:00:11.002 --> 00:00:12.480
- Well, you could have made it uh --

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.480
Dammit.

00:00:15.303 --> 00:00:16.860
- Oh my God, a four-for-two.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.360
- No, that doesn't sound right.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.270
- No. Your loss.

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.400
I sent out a mass email,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.320
Charlie's the only one who replied,

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.320
ergo, he's my 4-1.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.120
- Wait, but he paid for
it, so how is it your 4-1?

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:31.441
- Oh, because she told me
about the idea, so we're even.

00:00:31.441 --> 00:00:32.580
- Yeah, that.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.710
I'm just kidding, of
course we got some for you.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.580
- [All] Hey!

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:37.720
- Well thanks.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.240
- Aww, man.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.000
- Don't thank me,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.550
thank Charlie, it's all this guy.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:41.300
- Thanks, Charlie.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:41.840
- Thanks, buddy.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:42.300
- It's what I do.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.220
(slow guitar plucking)

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:47.240
- Hey, listen man,

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:48.860
no one else is gonna tell you this,

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.390
but I like to keep it real, ok?

00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:53.220
You might want to start
carrying some gum around.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.770
The boss told me the
only reason you're not

00:00:54.770 --> 00:00:57.020
getting more accounts is
because of your bad breath.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:57.880
(sniffs)

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:58.610
- Yeah.

00:00:58.610 --> 00:01:00.360
- Oh, I'm sorry.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:02.540
I eat a lot of olives.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:04.780
- So just keep some gum in your desk.

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:05.030
- Okay.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:05.396
- Cool?

00:01:05.396 --> 00:01:05.780
- Yeah.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:06.602
- Alright.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:07.812
(hands slap)

00:01:07.812 --> 00:01:08.062
- Thanks.

00:01:08.062 --> 00:01:08.950
- We're in this together.

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:11.830
(slow guitar plucking)

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:13.860
- Hey boss.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.460
So I told everyone that you're

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:17.490
getting the office lunch, for MLK day.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:18.290
- What?

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:19.790
- I just didn't want you
to seem racist, so...

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:20.410
- Oh.

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:21.270
- Thanks.

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:22.702
- Okay, I love MLK.

00:01:23.411 --> 00:01:24.130
I love MLK.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:27.292
(slow guitar plucking)

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:29.840
(candy wrappers rustling)

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:31.950
(pens clack)

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:33.140
(jar crashes)

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:34.090
- Harper, what are you doing?

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:35.730
- Shh, keep your mouth open.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:40.260
Keep your mouth shut.

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:43.354
(slow guitar plucking)

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:46.280
- Hey boss, I told everyone

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:48.352
you're ordering the office
lunch, for Yom Kippur.

00:01:48.352 --> 00:01:50.740
I didn't want you to like,
seem racist or anything.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.400
Alright, thanks.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:54.870
- But that's a fasting holiday.

00:01:54.874 --> 00:01:57.740
(slow guitar plucking)

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.120
- Hey, Elliott, did you
get any of that gum?

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.210
- Oh, yeah, I got a whole pack.

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.050
- Ohh, perfect.

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:05.300
- Yeah, here ya go.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:06.010
- I'll see ya later.

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:06.830
- Cool.

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:10.690
(slow guitar plucking)

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:12.720
- It's the best way to go.

00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:13.653
- What's with the cupcakes?

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:15.310
- They're for your birthday.

00:02:15.425 --> 00:02:17.270
- You know it's not my birthday.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.730
Who told you that it was today?

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:20.340
- Harper did.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:22.590
- You bought me cupcakes?

00:02:23.096 --> 00:02:23.820
- Happy birthday.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.990
- It's not my birthday,
you just wanted free food.

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:29.420
- Don't you have

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:31.280
a free cupcake

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:33.450
in your dainty little hand, Anna?

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:34.780
- Yeah, I do.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:35.120
- Yeah.

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:37.950
And if you wanna keep
getting free cupcakes,

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:40.500
you'll keep your pretty little mouth shut.

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:41.650
- Okay.

00:02:41.980 --> 00:02:45.495
(Spanish guitar)

00:02:45.743 --> 00:02:47.163
- Happy birthday.

00:02:47.912 --> 00:02:50.930
(slow guitar plucking)

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:52.890
- Happy birthday.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.720
- And I only had to pay for three.

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.520
- I haven't paid for anything since 1946.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:00.640
(laughter)

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:01.690
- How old are you?

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:02.470
- Shh.

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:04.053
- Alright, that's a cut.

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:06.370
(string intruments playing)

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.110
(film reel clacking)

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:12.320
(modem beeps)

